{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0a168b842657d23b0695847baf52728b6ab66d51f1aed10800b75841199351cf", "ja": "（今日もグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n美希の出番は、もうそろそろだろうか）", "zh": "（今天也要拍摄写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》。\n差不多快轮到美希出场了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "cabc6b692f83f5b32c2854f71c9356fe060205f01b8e54407a3e903198f82b21", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}。\nミキ、ちょっと聞きたいことがあるの。", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n美希有件事想问你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4d14b5b7ac5706c12b66bad682c238081555529989aa5ae24f11df9eda9a79d", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "774d9ac4e01bfed8a996c961ebf64a81962dc9a560bb22e4e54e82fde6bb517a", "ja": "あのね、男の子って、\nどうして屋上とか、体育館の裏が好きなの？", "zh": "那个啊，为什么你们男孩子，\n都喜欢屋顶和体育馆后面之类的地方呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ed9b16d521fb438dd1373da8ac73e3a4f25ef53bd68ee823376286dd35713bb2", "ja": "えっ？　そんなに好きだったかな……。\nどうしてそう思ったんだ？", "zh": "咦？应该也没那么喜欢吧……\n为什么你会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "be70663c5fb523dbeb4a1b4d3c835cebf80296709cf372aac846fca45f1652ed", "ja": "打ち合わせでね、カメラマンさんから\n「告白するときみたいに」って言われたんだけど……。", "zh": "在开会的时候呀，\n摄影师跟美希说「要像告白的时候一样」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "6cb8e8ed5581aecd56cac64edb38db8c2caf1cbfa18607e2dfb6b247d30ea77c", "ja": "そういえばミキ、だいたい屋上とか体育館の裏で\n告白されるから、どうしてかなと思って。", "zh": "所以美希就在想，这么说来美希大多是在屋顶和\n体育馆后面被告白，这到底是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0b7a3a64c6480b4946dfd6a7768976dcd080539baf8767c90145b6df655f806d", "ja": "だいたいそうなのか……。まあ、誰にも聞かれたくない\nとか、告白の雰囲気を作りやすい、とかかな？", "zh": "原来你大多是在那里被告白啊……这个嘛，原因应该是\n不想被别人听见，或是容易创造告白的气氛之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "a7319e457a00cc29a1021687de66670c03fe689363e7aa53e6869da17e0b641c", "ja": "告白の、雰囲気？", "zh": "告白的，气氛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6550ca85be0a4fbf04a58eeb4fa3d5e836fc6cefa440b99c9ab6c60bbd78a105", "ja": "そう、二人っきりって感じで、\nドキドキするというか。", "zh": "嗯，就像是只有两人独处，\n会让人有种小鹿乱撞的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "b9e163685b31bc5b56e294289bb47d8681511b7701a3df26b7c1ee22af7e96cd", "ja": "ふーん……。{$P$}は、\nどっちがいいの？", "zh": "哦～那{$P$}，\n你比较喜欢哪边呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2c008636de1dcaf275c4a4349f3108d94612b42753b82472b3848a0c8e51a64d", "ja": "え？　どっちというか……\nうーん、どっちがいいかな？", "zh": "咦？你问哪边啊……\n嗯～哪边比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "6982cf30c709424bbe6f44075760af66a63d312cb0c2ee84a50a1f3bca53cd50", "ja": "ミキが聞いてるの。……もしかして～。\n{$P$}、告白したことあるの？", "zh": "现在是美希在问你……难道～\n{$P$}，你有向人告白过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fddd12a9f2615dec9e2fdcf4e4711a69ae2a7df981d93b2dd1b26ef6832a917d", "ja": "いや、そういう話は……\nあ、美希、そろそろ時間だから準備しないと！", "zh": "不，这个话题有点……\n啊，美希，时间差不多了，必须赶快准备才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "2e5eeebfbc458654a980981af6ddbf1c1994d93e28f99bfd4c0a48b6f4112cc2", "ja": "むー、ごまかさないでっ！", "zh": "唔～不要蒙混过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c00647a08220026890751d3decf207ddf4ac1e0729632fc9717851ea0212423a", "ja": "でも、今日は夕方まで撮影で立て込んでるし。\n時間はしっかり守ってもらわないと困るよ。", "zh": "可是今天的拍摄一路排到傍晚，\n要是不好好遵守时间我会很困扰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "0f0a471e7590e64fe571977da596fb1918f550fa22bf374c466af4b678d6d626", "ja": "……。わかったの。\nミキ、ハニーを困らせたくないから、いくね。", "zh": "……知道了。\n美希不想让HONEY困扰，先走啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "8b56d3b467ef128ac2a965974689ac9d5169dbcb3be41a016ebb1082ab1e3c66", "ja": "でも、撮影が終わったら、続きお話してね？\n……約束っ。", "zh": "不过，等到拍摄结束以后，要继续聊刚才的话题唷！\n……说好了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9554d9229d3a178d234ff5ab662eedeaf41ace6c402d5c93fffcaf7c00f4f35a", "ja": "わ、わかった。考えておくよ。", "zh": "知、知道了，我会考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0133_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e4cb627e116fc05dfaaac1d797c36356bb96d20fa6452ac4e4b97cffa9e411ce", "ja": "（さて……。\n本当に、考えておかないと……！）", "zh": "（接下来……\n得先打好草稿才行了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
